	!VAR0516 : 1!
	\L_0a41f:
	\L_0a3cb:
	ZH 1:
	'A-A demon!?'
	\L_0a4f0:
	\L_0a4e3:
	\L_0a43b:
	ZH 1:
	'I came to offer some advice,'
	R
	'King of Leazas. Don’t get in'
	R
	'our way. We only wish to find'
	R
	'Little Princess.'
	\L_0a4f0:
	\L_0a4e3:
	\L_0a3cb:
	ZH 1:
	'...Little Princess?'
	\L_0a4f0:
	\L_0a4e3:
	\L_0a43b:
	ZH 1:
	'That’s right.'
	R
	'We know she escaped to this'
	R
	'country. Hand her over'
	R
	'obediently.'
	\L_0a4f0:
	ZH 1:
	'If you do, I’ll spare you your'
	R
	'life. You don’t want to die'
