	'Little Princess...'
	R
	'Little Princess...'
	R
	'Who’s that?'
	\L_0a4f0:
	ZH 1:
	'Don’t know them.'
	R
	'Anyway, who do you think'
	R
	'you’re talking to?'
	\L_0a4f0:
	ZH 1:
	'Why would I beg for my life to'
	R
	'you?'
	\L_0a4f0:
	\L_0a4e3:
	\L_0a43b:
	ZH 1:
	'Hmm... So that’s how you’re'
	R
	'gonna be... Fine, then.'
	\L_0a4f0:
	ZH 1:
	'I’ll make you tell me where'
	R
	'Little Princess is whether you'
	R
	'want to or not! Beg for your'
	R
	'life all you want!'
