	R
	'Patton, fought Rance and his'
	R
	'allies, and were defeated.'
	\L_0a4f0:
	ZH 1:
	'Gai’s will was this.'
	\L_0a4f0:
	ZH 1:
	'Have this world be governed by'
	R
	'Little Princess.'
	R
	'Then, bring order to the world'
	R
	'of monsters.'
	\L_0a4f0:
	ZH 1:
	'That is the ideal of those'
	R
	'that wish to carry out his'
	R
	'will.'
	\L_0a4f0:
	\L_0a4e3:
	\L_0a43b:
	ZH 1:
	'It’s very quiet around here'
	R
	'without Satella around...'
	\L_0a4f0:
	\L_0a4e3:
	\L_0a3cb:
	ZH 1:
	'That’s true...'
	R
	'She’s very rambunctious.'
	R
	'There’s a good side to that as'
	R
	'well, however.'
	\L_0a4f0:
	\L_0a4e3:
	\L_0a473:
	ZH 1:
	'They looked at the tea and'
	R
	'cakes sitting on the table and'
	R
	'sank into silence.'
	\L_0a4f0:
	ZH 1:
	'The same thing brought unease'
	R
	'to all three of their hearts.'
	\L_0a4f0:
	ZH 1:
	'Kayblis.'
	\L_0a4f0:
	ZH 1:
	'A demon with no interest in'
	R
	'the last Demon Lord’s will or'
	R
	'an orderly world. And there’s'
	R
	'many demons that follow him.'
	\L_0a4f0:
	ZH 1:
	'What they want isn’t order.'
	R
	'It’s slaughter, pleasure and'
	R
	'power. They desire a world of'
	R
	'blood.'
	\L_0a4f0:
	ZH 1:
	'They started an all-out attack'
	R
	'on Hornet’s group.'
	\L_0a4f0:
	ZH 1:
	'Due to that, Hornet sent out'
	R
	'Satella and Meglass to protect'
	R
	'the Demon Lord from Kayblis.'
	\L_0a4f0:
	ZH 1:
	'Without considering the danger'
	R
	'they were in themselves.'
	\L_0a4f0:
	\L_0a4e3:
	\L_0a49d:
	!VAR0516 : 73!
	\L_0a48f:
	\L_0a43b:
	ZH 1:
	'They’ve gotten very active.'
	\L_0a4f0:
	\L_0a4e3:
	\L_0a3cb:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes...'
	\L_0a4f0:
	\L_0a4e3:
	\L_0a43b:
	ZH 1:
	'Ms. Hornet.'
	R
	'If it’s come to this, there’s'
	R
	'one thing we can do.'
	\L_0a4f0:
	ZH 1:
	'We have to awaken Little'
	R
	'Princess as the Demon Lord,'
	R
	'there’s no time to wait for it'
	R
	'to happen naturally!'
	\L_0a4f0:
	ZH 1:
	'Let’s force Little Princess to'
	R
	'come here and make her take'
	R
	'her place as the Demon Lord...'
	\L_0a4f0:
	\L_0a4e3:
	\L_0a3cb:
	ZH 1:
	'We can’t force her.'
