	R
	'Hornet feels, Silky...'
	R
	'Force won’t solve anything.'
	\L_0a4f0:
	\L_0a4e3:
	\L_0a49d:
	!VAR0516 : 73!
	\L_0a48f:
	\L_0a43b:
	ZH 1:
	'That’s true... But...'
	\L_0a4f0:
	\L_0a4e3:
	\L_0a3cb:
	ZH 1:
	'I’m sure Satella and Meglass'
	R
	'will persuade her.'
